    <briefdescription>
<para>Result of a BPMN import operation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When <computeroutput>ok</computeroutput> is false:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>error_code</computeroutput> is set to a <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1process_1a2cbb7e8e1a91e903374c2ee9d43ee3a2" kindref="member">ProcessErrorCode</ref> indicating the failure category.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>message</computeroutput> contains an actionable diagnostic message for operator triage.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>All other fields are empty/default.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>When <computeroutput>ok</computeroutput> is true:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>error_code</computeroutput> is ignored (not checked by callers).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>nodes</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>edges</computeroutput> contain the parsed process graph. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
